IEEE Registration Authority: MAC address block assignments (MA-L, MA-M, MA-S, IAB)
https://standards.ieee.org/products-programs/regauth/
https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui/oui.csv (and oui28/mam.csv, oui36/oui36.csv, iab/iab.csv)

Used by: tools/make_oui.py, which turns the IEEE's public registry listings
into the board's vendor database (/sd/oui.bin, read by main/storage/oui.c).
No IEEE data is committed to this repository; the file is built on the PC
from the listings as published. The organisation names are the IEEE's public
registry data, shortened (corporate suffixes dropped, at most 40 characters).

